<!--
  The Amperly mark, for in-app use.

  The same bolt as the launcher icon, scaled onto a 24dp grid so it lines up with the rest
  of the icon set and can be tinted to whatever surface it lands on. Kept as a separate
  file from ic_launcher_foreground on purpose: the launcher version is tuned for a mask
  that crops its edges, this one is tuned to sit inside a toolbar or a badge.
-->
